{"id":"1ff681397acc990c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-set-hausdorff.md","title":"Cantor 空间的点到集原则","display":"thm-dim-set-hausdorff — Cantor 空间的点到集原则","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-set-hausdorff","aliases":["43-thm-dim-set-hausdorff"],"display":"thm-dim-set-hausdorff — Cantor 空间的点到集原则","depends_on":["[[43-thm-kc]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]","[[43-df-reldim]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Lutz–Lutz point-to-set principle, arXiv:1511.00442v4, Thm.1 (Euclidean statement); Cantor cylinder proof supplied locally; https://arxiv.org/pdf/1511.00442","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-set-hausdorff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-set-hausdorff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-set-hausdorff — Cantor 空间的点到集原则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64c95058f34a7a9b\" href=\"?note=64c95058f34a7a9b\" title=\"43-thm-kc\">43-thm-kc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b8ff6bb58783a25\" href=\"?note=4b8ff6bb58783a25\" title=\"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension\">43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" href=\"?note=bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" title=\"43-df-reldim\">43-df-reldim</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Lutz–Lutz point-to-set principle, arXiv:1511.00442v4, Thm.1 (Euclidean statement); Cantor cylinder proof supplied locally; <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1511.00442\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1511.00442</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；经典 Cantor Hausdorff 维数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b8ff6bb58783a25\" href=\"?note=4b8ff6bb58783a25\" title=\"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension\">43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension</a>，相对有效维数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" href=\"?note=bc5e1d2950e8a1f7\" title=\"43-df-reldim\">43-df-reldim</a>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\varnothing\">\\(E=\\varnothing\\)</span> 约定非负值的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\varnothing=0\">\\(\\sup\\varnothing=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)=\\inf_{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N}\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H^A(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)=\\inf_{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N}\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H^A(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所供2007稿没有2016/2017点到集原则。外部论文 Thm.1 为欧氏空间；以下独立核对 Cantor 圆柱版本，不通过不保持维数的任意拓扑同构转移结论。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\">\\(d=\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\varnothing\">\\(E=\\varnothing\\)</span>，两边均为0。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(E\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，先固定任意 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H^A(X)\">\\(b=\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H^A(X)\\)</span>。取有理数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t&gt;r&gt;b\">\\(t&gt;r&gt;b\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in E\">\\(X\\in E\\)</span> 有无穷多长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^A(X\\upharpoonright n)&lt;rn\">\\(K^A(X\\upharpoonright n)&lt;rn\\)</span>。因此对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>，长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^A(\\sigma)&lt;r|\\sigma|\">\\(K^A(\\sigma)&lt;r|\\sigma|\\)</span> 的圆柱覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的这类串至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{rn+1}\">\\(2^{rn+1}\\)</span> 个，其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 权重不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\ge N}2^{1-(t-r)n}\\to0\">\\(\\sum_{n\\ge N}2^{1-(t-r)n}\\to0\\)</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H^t(E)=0\">\\(\\mathcal H^t(E)=0\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\downarrow b\">\\(t\\downarrow b\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\le b\">\\(d\\le b\\)</span>，这对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>反向，对每个有理数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;d\">\\(r&gt;d\\)</span> 及正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 选一个圆柱覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{r,k}\">\\(D_{r,k}\\)</span>，各串长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k^2\">\\(k^2\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D_{r,k}}2^{-r|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}\">\\(\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D_{r,k}}2^{-r|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}\\)</span>。一个 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 编码全部这些可数覆盖。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>，相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 枚举 Kraft 请求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\lceil r|\\sigma|\\rceil+k,\\sigma)\">\\((\\lceil r|\\sigma|\\rceil+k,\\sigma)\\)</span>，总权重不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{k\\ge1}2^{-2k}&lt;1\">\\(\\sum_{k\\ge1}2^{-2k}&lt;1\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^A(\\sigma)\\le r|\\sigma|+k+O_r(1)\">\\(K^A(\\sigma)\\le r|\\sigma|+k+O_r(1)\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in E\">\\(X\\in E\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 都有这样的前缀，且长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k^2\">\\(k^2\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H^A(X)\\le r\">\\(\\dim_H^A(X)\\le r\\)</span>。同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 编码全部有理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;d\">\\(r&gt;d\\)</span>，故所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in E\">\\(X\\in E\\)</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H^A(X)\\le d\">\\(\\dim_H^A(X)\\le d\\)</span>。合并两个方向得到断言，并且该证明实际给出达到最小值的 oracle。</p>\n<p>证明仅使用圆柱覆盖定义、前缀自由描述计数和相对 Kraft–Chaitin 构造；不需要 E 可测、解析或有效。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-thm-kc","status":"resolved","id":"64c95058f34a7a9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-kc]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"4b8ff6bb58783a25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-reldim","status":"resolved","id":"bc5e1d2950e8a1f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-reldim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"4b8ff6bb58783a25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；经典 Cantor Hausdorff 维数见 [[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]，相对有效维数见 [[43-df-reldim]]；对 $E=\\varnothing$ 约定非负值的 $\\sup\\varnothing=0$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-reldim","status":"resolved","id":"bc5e1d2950e8a1f7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；经典 Cantor Hausdorff 维数见 [[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]，相对有效维数见 [[43-df-reldim]]；对 $E=\\varnothing$ 约定非负值的 $\\sup\\varnothing=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\varnothing=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)=\\inf_{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N}\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H^A(X).","display":true},{"tex":"d=\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"E\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"b=\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H^A(X)","display":false},{"tex":"t>r>b","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"K^A(X\\upharpoonright n)<rn","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"K^A(\\sigma)<r|\\sigma|","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{rn+1}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{n\\ge N}2^{1-(t-r)n}\\to0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H^t(E)=0","display":false},{"tex":"t\\downarrow b","display":false},{"tex":"d\\le b","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"r>d","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"D_{r,k}","display":false},{"tex":"k^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D_{r,k}}2^{-r|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"(\\lceil r|\\sigma|\\rceil+k,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{k\\ge1}2^{-2k}<1","display":false},{"tex":"K^A(\\sigma)\\le r|\\sigma|+k+O_r(1)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim_H^A(X)\\le r","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"r>d","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim_H^A(X)\\le d","display":false}],"bytes":2731,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-521","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-set-hausdorff]] — Cantor 空间的点到集原则"}],"outgoing":["64c95058f34a7a9b","6cd902d852c2c848","4b8ff6bb58783a25","bc5e1d2950e8a1f7"]}